  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: V3
  Title: Pressing another animation mid-play
  Summary: Long Trip takes 3 s and then switches the flag on.
  Watch: Box, Flag
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1231518770}
  - {fileID: 1608685644}
  HowTo: Play Long Trip, and Play Spin a second in. Stop and Restore.
  Expect: Pressing Spin first finishes Long Trip - the box jumps to the end and the
    tick appears - then spins there. Where Spin starts never depends on when you
    clicked. Stop and Restore hides the tick and puts the box home.
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
