  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: V10
  Title: The preview buttons in play mode
  Summary: In play mode the buttons call the player itself, and the footer adds Stop
    and Restore.
  Watch: Box
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1947643474}
  HowTo: In play mode, select this tile. Play Away, then Play Away again. Press Reset
    on Pop In. Then Stop and Restore.
  Expect: The second Away does nothing visible - it has no From and is already there;
    a note under the buttons says so. Reset on Pop In hides the box (it has a From).
    Stop and Restore puts the box back where it started.
  Needs: 6
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 1480343757}
  Stage: {fileID: 610450106}
  Footer: {fileID: 425530231}
