  m_text: <b>Expect:</b> Saving doesn't visibly change anything - the preview carries
    on. After Stop and Restore the scene doesn't show as changed. Reopened, the box
    is at rest, the bar full, the text thin, and the Fill Bar's material is Lab Fill,
    not an (Instance).
