  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: V12
  Title: Every preview Play starts from the first frame
  Summary: Credits rests dimmed (alpha 0.4). Close Credits fades it from 1 to 0 after
    a 0.6 s delay, with Apply From Values Immediately off.
  Watch: Credits
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 2018108026}
  HowTo: Preview Close Credits. Then in play mode click Close Credits, then Show
    Again.
  Expect: 'Preview: Credits jumps to fully shown at once, holds, then fades out -
    every preview Play is Reset then Play. Play mode: it stays dim for 0.6 s, then
    flashes to full and fades - the setting is off, and the preview deliberately
    doesn''t copy that.'
  Needs: 3
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
